WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.430
Three friends push a
broken-down car forwards.

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:06.830
At the same time, a tow-rope
tied to the back pulls it the

3
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:07.930
other way.

4
00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.550
The car doesn't move an inch.

5
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.790
Everyone is straining,
yet nothing happens.

6
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.230
So are there really no
forces acting on it?

7
00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:20.670
In this mission, you'll sort
forces into contact and

8
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:25.130
non-contact forces, and see why
every force has both a size and

9
00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:25.910
a direction.

10
00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:27.870
You'll draw free-body diagrams,

11
00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:31.650
and work out the single
resultant force on an object.

12
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:35.570
Your mission: find out whether
the car really has no forces on

13
00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:36.270
it.
